      },
      "source": [
        "## Steps Followed in the Algorithm\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Import Libraries** — numpy, pandas, matplotlib, scikit-learn  \n",
        "2. **Load the Dataset** — read the CSV file into a pandas DataFrame  \n",
        "3. **Explore the Data** — check shape, info, and statistical summary  \n",
        "4. **Visualize the Raw Data** — scatter plot to confirm a linear pattern  \n",
        "5. **Prepare the Data** — separate independent (X) and dependent (y) variables  \n",
        "6. **Split the Data** — 80% training and 20% testing  \n",
        "7. **Train the Model** — fit `LinearRegression` on the training set  \n",
        "8. **Inspect Coefficients** — view learned slope (m) and intercept (c)  \n",
        "9. **Make Predictions** — predict salaries on the test set  \n",
        "10. **Evaluate the Model** — MAE, MSE, RMSE, and R² score  \n",
        "11. **Visualize the Results** — regression line on training and test data  \n",
        "12. **Predict for New Values** — estimate salary for unseen experience values"
      ]
